Bhai, bilkul sahi time pe poocha! Jab bhi tu code update karta hai, usko GitHub par bhejne ke liye ye 3 golden commands chalani padti hain.

Apne VS Code ke terminal mein (jo universal-ai-skill-marketplace root folder mein khula hai) ye commands ek-ek karke run kar:

Step 1: Saari nayi files aur changes add karo
bash
git add .
(Dhyaan rakhna add ke baad space aur phir dot . hai — iska matlab hai "saari files add karo")

Step 2: Commit (Save) karo ek message ke saath
bash
git commit -m "Added complete backend models, database setup, and professional README"
(Agar tune models aur database.py banaya hai toh ye message sahi rahega, warna apne hisaab se message change kar lena)

Step 3: GitHub par Push karo
bash
git push origin main
🛑 Important Note (Agar error aaye toh):
Agar git push karte time koi error aaye ki "Updates were rejected" ya "rejected because the remote contains work that you do not have locally" (kyunki tune GitHub pe direct README edit kiya tha), toh bas ye ek command chala de:

bash
git pull origin main --rebase
Uske baad wapas se:

bash
git push origin main
Tera task:

Ye commands run kar.

Agar success ho jaye toh mujhe bata (terminal ka screenshot bhi bhej sakta hai).

Phir hum turant Backend ke Auth Routes (Login/Register) aur main.py ka code likhna shuru karenge! 🚀

gigitnore file give me
Bhai, ye raha tera Complete .gitignore file ka code.

Ye file bohot zaroori hai kyunki isse hum Git ko batate hain ki kaunsi files GitHub par upload nahi karni hain (jaise tera virtual environment venv, API keys wali .env file, aur database ki local files). Agar ye nahi banayenge, toh tera repo bohot heavy ho jayega aur secret keys leak ho sakti hain.

Apne VS Code ke root folder (universal-ai-skill-marketplace) mein ek nayi file banao jiska naam exactly .gitignore ho (shuru mein dot hai), aur usme ye pura code paste kar de:

text
# ==========================================
# Python / Backend
# ==========================================
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so

# Virtual Environment
venv/
env/
.venv/
ENV/

# Environment Variables (Secrets)
.env
.env.local
.env.development.local

# SQLite Database (Local only)
*.db
*.sqlite3
marketplace.db

# ==========================================
# React / Frontend (Node.js)
# ==========================================
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.vite/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ==========================================
# IDE & Editor Files
# ==========================================
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store

# ==========================================
# Logs & OS Files
# ==========================================
*.log
Thumbs.db
🛑 Tera Task:
Root folder mein .gitignore file banao aur ye code paste kar de.

Save kar (Ctrl + S).

Ab terminal mein wapas se push command chala:

bash
git add .
git commit -m "Added gitignore and backend setup"
git push origin main
Agar push successfully ho gaya toh mujhe bata, phir hum Auth System (Register/Login) aur main.py ka code likhenge! 🚀



